{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/c3cbae798a90cebb0a2ef1d09279927b.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to be sent on missions to collect gnomium, along with up to 3 friends of choice. Your goal is simple: collect enough gnomium to keep the High-Gnome happy to live a <span class=\"bb_strike\">relaxed</span>\u00a0privileged life on their plateau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.poster.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.webm?t=1759685747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.mp4?t=1759685747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/32c15602a54b81d1bf6effead7e200d2.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal household appliances and anything else you can find while hunting for gnomium to gather various resources. Use these resources to craft equipment and furniture for your home, which serves as your base of operations during missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.poster.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.webm?t=1759685747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.mp4?t=1759685747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/4dfce2e429987b2c459abc5cb8171b05.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes are small and fragile, and often hunted by other beings. Interact with the environment and use your equipment to slow them down. Stay vigilant, and be ready to rescue one another. The High-Gnome doesn't like resurrecting unworthy gnomes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844970?t=1759685747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/8aae66e4daff3deeb8068e4060a5b25eac4ad907/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759685747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/8d332792fad446d6a5a2c4a2f05138ec40572ce5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759685747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/8d332792fad446d6a5a2c4a2f05138ec40572ce5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759685747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The gnomes can get dismembered, exploded, or die in other brutal ways.\r\nThere is no sexual content, however the human might appear naked to perform daily activities like taking a bath. Sensitive areas have been censored, and nothing obscene can be seen at any point."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/c3cbae798a90cebb0a2ef1d09279927b.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to be sent on missions to collect gnomium, along with up to 3 friends of choice. Your goal is simple: collect enough gnomium to keep the High-Gnome happy to live a <span class=\"bb_strike\">relaxed</span>\u00a0privileged life on their plateau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.poster.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.webm?t=1759685747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.mp4?t=1759685747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/32c15602a54b81d1bf6effead7e200d2.avif?t=1759685747\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal household appliances and anything else you can find while hunting for gnomium to gather various resources. Use these resources to craft equipment and furniture for your home, which serves as your base of operations during missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp